{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17757","headline":"元日含元殿下立仗丹凤楼门下宣赦相公称贺二首 一 · 杨巨源","name":"元日含元殿下立仗丹凤楼门下宣赦相公称贺二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天垂台耀扫欃枪，寿献香山祝圣明。\n丹凤楼前歌九奏，金鸡竿下鼓千声。\n衣冠南面薰风动，文字东方喜气生。\n从此登封资庙略，两河连海一时清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}